      "writtenOn": "2025-06-10T15:02:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I feel a more natural approach would be `zmake build brox/*`?  Anything before the `/` would be considered the `--projects-dir`. Could we get something like this to work?",
      "revId": "581cb5c384be454ba1a83cd12756cc3aa952361c",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
